{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02636",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.33,
      "end_seconds": 6.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "doctor, I've brought them through. The observations are done, whenever you need them"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.79,
      "end_seconds": 16.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Thanks. Hello, come in, sit down. What brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 21.94,
      "end_seconds": 38.87,
      "duration_seconds": 16.93,
      "text": "Well, you know, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay. I mean, doctor, it's severe thirst and passing lots of urine. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.19,
      "end_seconds": 44.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "So, can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.91,
      "end_seconds": 58.77,
      "duration_seconds": 13.86,
      "text": "Honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It It might have been last month or the month before, I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.72,
      "end_seconds": 64.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Okay, is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.95,
      "end_seconds": 73.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "Right, uh, maybe a six out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.51,
      "end_seconds": 81.91,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 82.01,
      "end_seconds": 88.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "Let me think, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.41,
      "end_seconds": 98.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "I was getting to that! I've had bone pain too, for about four days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.53,
      "end_seconds": 102.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.43,
      "end_seconds": 109.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly. I've, I've also had vomiting, since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.28,
      "end_seconds": 114.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.74,
      "end_seconds": 116.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Moderate, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.62,
      "end_seconds": 121.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Right, have you had being very confused?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.57,
      "end_seconds": 126.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Yeah. Four weeks, you know, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.64,
      "end_seconds": 130.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.38,
      "end_seconds": 140.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.94,
      "text": "Well, um, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.36,
      "end_seconds": 146.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.28,
      "end_seconds": 149.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.17,
      "end_seconds": 155.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "A few quick ones: fever, chest pain or fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.56,
      "end_seconds": 162.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "no fever, chest pain or fall, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.21,
      "end_seconds": 167.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.38,
      "end_seconds": 174.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Oh, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.65,
      "end_seconds": 179.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.65,
      "end_seconds": 183.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I've, I've had eczema, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.53,
      "end_seconds": 190.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Alright, eczema, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.65,
      "end_seconds": 207.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.58,
      "end_seconds": 211.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "My daughter has type 1 diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.5,
      "end_seconds": 215.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.2,
      "end_seconds": 220.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "No, you know, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.31,
      "end_seconds": 222.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.6,
      "end_seconds": 226.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.45,
      "end_seconds": 230.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "alright, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.4,
      "end_seconds": 234.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.45,
      "end_seconds": 238.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.14,
      "end_seconds": 248.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.58,
      "end_seconds": 256.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "Okay, are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.44,
      "end_seconds": 265.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Not to to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 266.74,
      "end_seconds": 275.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.26,
      "text": "I'm, I'm not sure that's right. I seem to recall a problem with naproxen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.13,
      "end_seconds": 278.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Well, I don't remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.37,
      "end_seconds": 285.57,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "Alright, fair enough, I'll write down both versions. Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.87,
      "end_seconds": 289.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 291.44,
      "end_seconds": 305.05,
      "duration_seconds": 13.61,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pressure 98 over 63, BMI works out to 30.0. Weight 73 kilos, pulse is 104 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, height 156 centimetres, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.38,
      "end_seconds": 307.08,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.47,
      "end_seconds": 312.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.64,
      "end_seconds": 316.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.25,
      "end_seconds": 340.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "You are dehydrated and drowsy with a slow, odd rhythm on the monitor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.45,
      "end_seconds": 364.97,
      "duration_seconds": 21.52,
      "text": "You can relax now. Okay, thinking it through, it fits best with a high calcium emergency. I'd also keep a kidney failure in mind. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had severe thirst and passing lots of urine, and no chest pain or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.01,
      "end_seconds": 367.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.72,
      "end_seconds": 412.05,
      "duration_seconds": 30.33,
      "text": "We should do urgent blood tests for confusion and polyuria. We should do an ECG for hypercalcaemia. What I'm giving you is sodium chloride 0.9%, 1 litre, over one hour, single dose. That should help with dehydration. You need hospital fluids and treatment now. If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 413.89,
      "end_seconds": 418.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Mm, uh, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.58,
      "end_seconds": 421.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}